(34,'Frostwall Tavern','Lunarfall Inn','Adventure!  Excitement! A Hero and his followers need all these things, along with a place to rest afterward.','Each day, a visitor offering a dungeon quest with generous rewards will spend the day at your inn.',2,5,230416,224805,0,1,3600,824,100,7,6,134414,1234,1233,0,1,0,0,150,1),
